@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 18
}

rectangle "README" as Readme
rectangle "Quick Start" as Quick
rectangle "Core Concepts" as Concepts
rectangle "Tutorials" as Tutorials
rectangle "JSON Reference" as Reference
rectangle "Development Guide" as Dev
rectangle "Architecture\nand Standards" as DeepDive

Readme --> Quick : see a demo
Readme --> Concepts : learn the vocabulary
Quick --> Tutorials : reproduce the flow
Concepts --> Reference : exact JSON syntax
Quick --> Dev : build / test
Tutorials --> DeepDive : advanced behavior
@enduml
